[
  {"comment": "Fill Cavity (mitcad#1818) on the geometry kernel, with analytic volumes. A block 40 x 20 x 15 (Box1, F1, F1.b0) with a wall 20 x 20 x 5 on its right half (Box2, F2, joined: the wall's top at 20), a blind V slit along the wall's foot in the lower half (Sketch1 F3 on XZ moved 5 along its normal +Y by its frame, its y along -Z: the triangle (18, 15), (20, 15), (20, 10); Extrude1 F4 cuts it 10 to y = 15: 2 x 5 / 2 x 10 = 50) and a pocket 5 x 10, 5 deep, in the lower half (Box3 F5 from (5, 5, 10): 250). 14000 - 50 - 250 = 13700."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "corner": [0, 0], "length": 40, "width": 20, "height": 15, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box",
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [20, 0, 15], "normal": [0, 0, 1], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0]},
    "length": 20, "width": 20, "height": 5, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sketch",
    "plane": "xz", "frame": {"origin": [0, 0, 5], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0], "y_axis": [0, 1, 0]}, "entities": [
    {"id": "p1", "type": "point", "at": [18, -15]},
    {"id": "p2", "type": "point", "at": [20, -15]},
    {"id": "p3", "type": "point", "at": [20, -10]},
    {"id": "c4", "type": "line", "start": "p1", "end": "p2"},
    {"id": "c5", "type": "line", "start": "p2", "end": "p3"},
    {"id": "c6", "type": "line", "start": "p3", "end": "p1"}]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c4[c6,c5],c5[c4,c6],c6[c5,c4]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box",
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [5, 5, 10], "normal": [0, 0, 1], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0]},
    "length": 5, "width": 10, "height": 10, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 1}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13700, "tolerance": 1e-9,
    "has_face": "F4:side(c6[c5,c4])"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F5:bottom"}},

  {"comment": "Plane1 (F6) 15 above XY: the lower half's top. FillCavity1 (F7) without a seed fills every pocket the cap closes, the slit and the pocket: the block whole again, its top on the cap named after the fill, the slit's and the pocket's walls gone."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "construction_plane",
    "definition": {"type": "offset", "plane": "xy", "distance": 15}}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 14000, "tolerance": 1e-9,
    "has_face": "F7:fill", "no_face": "F4:side(c6[c5,c4])"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "no_face": "F5:bottom", "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [40, 20, 20]}}},

  {"comment": "A seed picks the pocket: a wall of the slit fills the slit only, the pocket's floor the pocket only."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F7", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6",
    "seed": "F4:side(c6[c5,c4])"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13750, "tolerance": 1e-9,
    "no_face": "F4:side(c6[c5,c4])", "has_face": "F5:bottom"}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F7", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6",
    "seed": "F5:bottom"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13950, "tolerance": 1e-9,
    "no_face": "F5:bottom", "has_face": "F4:side(c6[c5,c4])"}},

  {"comment": "The cap moved down to 13 recomputes the fill without a seed: the V 3 deep of its 5 (1.2 wide at 13, 1.8 mm2 over 10 mm: 18) and the pocket 3 deep (150); the slit's slanted wall above the cap stays."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F7", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6"}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F6", "def": {"type": "construction_plane",
    "definition": {"type": "offset", "plane": "xy", "distance": 13}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13868, "tolerance": 1e-9,
    "has_face": "F7:fill", "max": [40, 20, 20]}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "has_face": "F4:side(c6[c5,c4])"}},
  {"comment": "The offset moves the cap along its normal: 13 + 2 = 15, the block whole again."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F7", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6",
    "offset": "2 mm"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 14000, "tolerance": 1e-9}},

  {"comment": "A tunnel through the wall below the cap, open at both ends (Box4 F8: 2 x 20 x 4 from (30, -1, 8), 160): FillCavity2 (F9) seeded on its floor refuses in words, the body as it was; without a seed nothing is closed below the cap."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box",
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [30, -1, 8], "normal": [0, 0, 1], "x_axis": [1, 0, 0]},
    "length": 2, "width": 22, "height": 4, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13840, "tolerance": 1e-9}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6", "offset": "2 mm",
    "seed": "F8:bottom"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity2", "status": "error",
    "error_contains": "the cavity opens out of the body below the cap"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13840, "tolerance": 1e-9, "has_face": "F8:bottom"}},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F9", "def": {"type": "fill_cavity", "body": "F1.b0", "cap": "F6",
    "offset": "2 mm"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "FillCavity2", "status": "error",
    "error_contains": "found no closed cavity below the cap to fill"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F1.b0", "volume": 13840, "tolerance": 1e-9}}
]
